WEBVTT

00:01.900 --> 00:04.800
I wonder what Ayako-san wants to tell me.

00:06.030 --> 00:08.400
That little glass bottle I got for her broke.

00:09.020 --> 00:15.290
In the snow, she looked so far away...

00:15.290 --> 00:18.730
Like I could never reach her.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

02:00.780 --> 02:02.140
Where are you going?

02:04.770 --> 02:07.230
N-Nowhere, really...

02:07.230 --> 02:09.000
It’s a nice night out.

02:09.000 --> 02:11.860
You should leave them be.

02:19.350 --> 02:23.030
Meant for You

02:29.900 --> 02:30.990
Ayako-san...

02:35.260 --> 02:37.440
I’m sorry for making you come out here.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.490
No...

02:38.490 --> 02:41.240
Um, the snowfall’s gotten heavier, hasn’t it?

02:41.240 --> 02:42.820
You must be cold, Mamoru.

02:42.820 --> 02:44.470
N-Not at all.

02:44.470 --> 02:46.270
Don’t force yourself.

02:46.270 --> 02:48.680
Really, don’t worry about me.

02:48.680 --> 02:51.100
You’ve gotta be cold!

02:51.100 --> 02:52.950
I’m really all right.

02:53.810 --> 02:56.100
You need to be cold, OK?!

02:57.760 --> 02:59.760
O-Open it up.

02:59.760 --> 03:01.450
Sure...

03:01.450 --> 03:03.550
Shione taught me...

03:03.550 --> 03:07.070
She makes all those awful clothes herself,

03:07.070 --> 03:08.700
so she’s good at this stuff.

03:08.700 --> 03:12.140
This is a sweater...

03:12.920 --> 03:16.850
I heard we were going on a ski trip again this year.

03:16.850 --> 03:19.950
I wanted it to be ready before we left, but...

03:22.530 --> 03:24.350
<i>I see.</i>

03:24.620 --> 03:27.270
<i>The reason she didn’t come to pick me up...</i>

03:27.620 --> 03:30.480
<i>And why she was sleepy all the time...</i>

03:31.140 --> 03:32.770
<i>It was that she was making this sweater?</i>

03:32.770 --> 03:35.190
H-Hey, don’t stare at it!

03:35.190 --> 03:39.270
But it looks OK, doesn’t it?

03:39.270 --> 03:40.830
Well, it’s not as good as Shione’s...

03:39.550 --> 03:44.290
<i>She cares so much for me,</i>

03:44.290 --> 03:46.620
<i>and here I was, getting uneasy...</i>

03:47.540 --> 03:50.780
<i>I wanted to give her a present, too.</i>

03:50.780 --> 03:53.320
<i>I wanted to show her how I feel!</i>

03:55.310 --> 03:56.410
Mamoru?

03:56.410 --> 03:59.010
I-I’m sorry! It’s nothing.

03:59.010 --> 04:00.070
I’m happy...

04:00.070 --> 04:01.320
Thank you!

04:03.700 --> 04:06.300
If something has happened, tell me.

04:08.180 --> 04:11.650
If there’s anything you can’t resolve alone,

04:11.650 --> 04:16.820
no matter what it is, I’ll take care of it.

04:18.140 --> 04:19.360
Ayako-san...

04:23.960 --> 04:26.370
Witch Beatrice.

04:27.620 --> 04:31.780
Is it Yoshimura Mamoru who has changed you?

04:32.450 --> 04:37.130
The presence of something important,
that you want to protect?

04:37.130 --> 04:38.640
That voice...

04:39.940 --> 04:43.280
If you’ve taken up such fetters of your own free will,

04:43.280 --> 04:46.920
then you’ve fallen far, indeed!

04:49.800 --> 04:51.230
Mamoru, watch out!

05:13.260 --> 05:14.310
What was that?

05:14.310 --> 05:15.000
Wait.

05:15.000 --> 05:18.380
The idiot who caused that avalanche is out there.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.530
Get down here!

05:29.890 --> 05:33.280
U-Um, shouldn’t we save her?

05:33.280 --> 05:35.430
That isn’t enough to kill her.

05:36.850 --> 05:39.670
One year ago this summer,

05:39.670 --> 05:43.650
something important took the
Student Council President and me to Germany.

05:43.650 --> 05:52.490
There, I met the Dark Lord of Prussia,
Johan Dieter Rudiger.

05:52.490 --> 05:55.010
The President told me about him.

05:55.910 --> 06:01.410
He has an adopted little sister that he raised.

06:01.410 --> 06:04.080
A shameless little girl, who claimed

06:04.080 --> 06:09.230
her very life exists for no other
reason than to serve him.

06:09.960 --> 06:13.670
What brought you all the way out here,
from the German countryside?

06:13.670 --> 06:16.480
Emelenzia Beatrix Rudiger!

06:23.550 --> 06:25.960
Testing you, of course!

06:31.040 --> 06:32.620
As I thought.

06:33.090 --> 06:35.660
The mere presence of Yoshimura Mamoru

06:35.660 --> 06:37.610
renders you unable to concentrate.

06:37.610 --> 06:40.250
Where did you get that sword?

06:46.580 --> 06:52.120
The girl I knew wouldn’t cling
to a fantasy like love.

06:58.680 --> 07:03.040
You believed yourself absolutely alone,
like my brother.

07:03.040 --> 07:05.820
And your strength was overwhelming.

07:05.820 --> 07:10.610
I thought that someone as
noble and beautiful as you

07:10.610 --> 07:13.100
had no need for others.

07:13.100 --> 07:15.330
In fact, none would come near you.

07:16.510 --> 07:22.090
You’d spend your life alone, without love,
not even in your final years!

07:22.700 --> 07:24.060
Why, you...

07:24.060 --> 07:25.500
It’s a compliment.

07:25.500 --> 07:30.300
My brother said that women
change when they’re in love.

07:31.640 --> 07:35.230
He told me to observe you, to test you,

07:35.230 --> 07:37.600
and then to give you a message.

07:38.770 --> 07:40.250
But before that,

07:40.250 --> 07:43.940
I have to decide how you’ve changed,

07:43.940 --> 07:47.230
having met Yoshimura Mamoru.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.480
All right, then...

07:49.480 --> 07:52.820
Let’s see what you think!

07:53.500 --> 07:56.050
The beatrice is shaking...

07:56.840 --> 08:02.710
<i>Mamoru, the next time I attack,
run toward the villa and don’t look back.</i>

08:03.290 --> 08:03.960
<i>Got it?</i>

08:15.690 --> 08:19.430
If you’re focused elsewhere,
you’ll get the rug pulled from under you.

08:19.430 --> 08:21.380
Or actually, Yoshimura Mamoru will.

08:24.290 --> 08:26.670
I-I-I-I-It was so cold...

08:26.670 --> 08:29.110
I thought we were gonna d-d-die...

08:31.590 --> 08:32.360
Mamoru!

08:36.160 --> 08:38.660
Don’t move.

08:38.660 --> 08:42.160
One step forward, and the kid goes down.

08:42.160 --> 08:44.570
Get away from him!

08:44.570 --> 08:46.910
They’re beatrice users, too.

08:47.460 --> 08:51.710
They appeared when I
searched for people to help me.

08:51.710 --> 08:54.450
Did you forget us, Witch Beatrice?

08:54.450 --> 08:57.120
One winter morning, five years ago,

08:57.120 --> 09:01.190
we two brothers tried to rob a bank.

09:01.190 --> 09:04.670
Then you came and hurt us!

09:04.670 --> 09:08.890
But bank robbery is way worse than that!

09:12.160 --> 09:16.470
If you’re going to test me, fight fair!

09:16.470 --> 09:21.330
The person I saw a year ago would
have dealt with this somehow.

09:21.330 --> 09:26.040
But Yoshimura Mamoru might
have been slightly injured.

09:27.290 --> 09:29.910
Is that everything?

09:29.910 --> 09:35.820
You told my brother that the
next time you met, you’d destroy him.

09:35.820 --> 09:39.350
Still, I looked up to you!

09:39.860 --> 09:45.150
Have you ever thought about
how much you mean to my brother?

09:45.150 --> 09:49.770
Can you see how hard I’ve worked to surpass you?

09:49.770 --> 09:50.940
Emelenzia...

09:50.940 --> 09:55.750
You insult me... My brother...

09:55.750 --> 09:59.870
You really are lovey-dovey!

10:04.830 --> 10:05.750
Huh?

10:05.750 --> 10:09.390
Boss, you screwed up the big line...

10:10.570 --> 10:12.790
It’s my fault for teaching it to her in a weird way!

10:13.290 --> 10:15.170
Saburou, here.

10:19.720 --> 10:21.970
Please shoot Yoshimura Mamoru.

10:22.560 --> 10:23.600
Stop it!

10:23.600 --> 10:24.470
Ayako-san!

10:24.760 --> 10:26.190
Don’t touch Mamoru...

10:35.520 --> 10:36.380
Ayako-san...

10:37.940 --> 10:39.010
Ayako-san?

10:41.770 --> 10:43.610
Ayako-san?!

10:47.920 --> 10:51.280
We came here to relax...

10:51.280 --> 10:54.300
Jeez, I can’t believe there was an avalanche.

10:54.300 --> 10:57.350
Beatrice caused this.

10:58.420 --> 10:59.760
Mamoru!

10:59.760 --> 11:02.390
Mamoru was out there...

11:02.390 --> 11:03.440
It’s OK.

11:03.440 --> 11:06.790
According to the President, Ayako was with him.

11:06.790 --> 11:07.940
That’s right.

11:07.940 --> 11:10.050
This is nothing for her.

11:10.050 --> 11:11.350
Mamoru!

11:14.540 --> 11:15.940
No... Mamoru!

11:17.040 --> 11:19.100
No...

11:21.780 --> 11:23.460
Mamoru...

11:23.460 --> 11:25.150
Mamoru!

11:30.200 --> 11:31.540
Ayako-san!

11:35.080 --> 11:36.570
Ayako-san...

11:38.130 --> 11:41.320
How long have we waited for this?

11:41.320 --> 11:43.600
Take that, Witch Beatrice!

11:43.600 --> 11:45.380
You’re nothing.

11:45.380 --> 11:46.350
Shut up.

11:46.350 --> 11:50.050
You have no right to talk about her that way!

11:50.050 --> 11:51.400
What?

11:51.400 --> 11:53.600
You understand your position?

11:53.600 --> 11:56.060
She’s just unconscious.

11:56.060 --> 11:58.030
She’ll wake up in a couple hours.

12:00.450 --> 12:04.580
I feel bad for ruining your trip.

12:04.580 --> 12:06.800
But I won’t apologize.

12:06.800 --> 12:11.370
Due to you, my beatrice weakened.

12:12.160 --> 12:15.080
You’re not worthy of her.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.840
Let him down!

12:17.840 --> 12:18.680
OK.

12:20.220 --> 12:21.760
Ayako-san!

12:24.840 --> 12:28.280
Man, good work, boss!

12:28.280 --> 12:32.690
Let’s get a photo of her knocked out like that!

12:36.590 --> 12:37.860
No...

12:38.590 --> 12:41.740
Ayako-san is stronger than anyone!

12:41.740 --> 12:43.370
It’s because I was here.

12:43.370 --> 12:45.580
It’s my fault!

12:45.580 --> 12:47.190
That’s right.

12:47.190 --> 12:48.370
Ayako-san is...

12:48.370 --> 12:51.150
What are you mumbling, kid?

12:51.150 --> 12:55.170
Ayako-san hasn’t lost to you guys!

13:02.880 --> 13:04.850
What did that kid do?

13:09.360 --> 13:10.730
<i>Ayako-san...</i>

13:28.780 --> 13:30.500
Ayako-san?

13:30.500 --> 13:34.580
<i>I felt what you were thinking, all of it.</i>

13:39.750 --> 13:41.700
Witch Beatrice...

13:42.610 --> 13:46.630
You’re right! I may be weaker!

13:46.630 --> 13:50.440
I lacked resolve.

13:50.440 --> 13:53.460
I didn’t trust Mamoru enough.

13:54.180 --> 13:56.210
But I’m over that.

13:56.210 --> 14:00.590
I know how much he trusts me.

14:01.120 --> 14:03.110
I won’t hold back anymore.

14:03.640 --> 14:07.460
You’ve exposed a huge vulnerability, for sure.

14:07.460 --> 14:10.990
If that happens again...

14:13.220 --> 14:14.660
It’s simple.

14:14.660 --> 14:17.830
I just need to be stronger than I am now.

14:17.830 --> 14:21.590
So that he’ll be okay, no matter what happens to us.

14:21.590 --> 14:25.640
I will not let you touch my Mamoru.

14:26.390 --> 14:28.380
Anyone can talk!

14:39.990 --> 14:41.230
Why?

14:41.230 --> 14:44.930
What is it about him that gives you such strength?

14:46.650 --> 14:52.270
You’d never understand, hanging out
with a weirdo like Johan.

14:52.270 --> 14:55.440
H-How rude! How dare you?

14:59.750 --> 15:04.700
My brother is the strongest, smartest,
nicest, and most perfect.

15:04.700 --> 15:06.900
He’s like a god!

15:06.900 --> 15:09.300
You don’t know how to pick guys.

15:09.300 --> 15:12.340
He’s just a selfish narcissist!

15:13.510 --> 15:17.430
Mamoru’s got a cute smile, and he’s really nice.

15:17.430 --> 15:20.860
And when I need it, he really helps me.
And his cheeks are so squishy...

15:20.860 --> 15:22.770
Um, Ayako-san...

15:22.770 --> 15:27.470
I’ll admit he has a nice smile, but that’s it!

15:28.040 --> 15:31.830
He’s got a stupid grin,
and he lets a girl drag him around...

15:31.830 --> 15:34.070
My brother’s a million times cooler!

15:34.070 --> 15:35.400
No way!

15:35.400 --> 15:39.370
Mamoru’s a billion times cooler!

15:42.790 --> 15:44.460
My brother’s a hundred billion times cooler!

15:45.890 --> 15:47.920
A trillion times!

15:47.920 --> 15:50.060
Ten quadrillion times!

15:50.060 --> 15:52.780
Then, an infinite number of times!

15:57.260 --> 15:59.300
You can’t beat infinity.

15:59.300 --> 16:00.610
Mamoru wins.

16:00.610 --> 16:04.450
My brother’s attractiveness can’t
be captured numerically.

16:07.480 --> 16:10.310
You started it!

16:26.240 --> 16:27.900
Well?

16:27.900 --> 16:34.090
You still gonna tell me how
Mamoru’s made me weak?

16:34.090 --> 16:35.480
No.

16:36.040 --> 16:41.060
I guess you do have the right
to hear my brother’s message.

16:41.060 --> 16:45.550
And you, too, lover of Witch Beatrice...

16:57.600 --> 16:59.490
Hey!

16:59.490 --> 17:01.950
Mamoru-kun!

17:01.950 --> 17:06.540
Ayako! Mamoru-san!

17:03.550 --> 17:04.750
Ayako!

17:26.600 --> 17:30.640
I feel bad for making everyone worry.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.820
Especially Ayako-san...

17:40.290 --> 17:42.110
You seem tired.

17:42.110 --> 17:43.980
Yes.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.710
Wait.

17:47.710 --> 17:50.840
As a girl, shouldn’t I be the one screaming here?

17:50.840 --> 17:52.910
Th-That’s true.

17:52.910 --> 17:54.840
Why are you here, anyway?

17:55.330 --> 17:59.920
Jirou and Saburou said they’d
look for a car, so we can go home.

18:00.640 --> 18:05.270
I snuck in here to enjoy a bath.

18:05.270 --> 18:07.150
Snuck in here...

18:10.310 --> 18:12.940
Um, that hurts.

18:12.940 --> 18:15.060
Witch Beatrice was right.

18:15.060 --> 18:16.950
Your cheeks are squishy.

18:16.950 --> 18:20.440
She’s never lied.

18:20.440 --> 18:21.610
Emelenzia...

18:21.610 --> 18:27.620
She’s the first person I ever
looked up to, besides my brother.

18:28.460 --> 18:34.090
I became strong because I wanted to be like her,
and so she would recognize me.

18:34.090 --> 18:37.620
To be honest, I’m a little jealous of you.

18:37.620 --> 18:41.000
How she cares enough to knit you a sweater...

18:41.000 --> 18:45.250
Yes. I feel bad about how much she does for me,

18:45.250 --> 18:47.270
when I do nothing in return.

18:47.270 --> 18:50.490
The present I got her broke...

18:50.490 --> 18:51.560
Present?

18:52.240 --> 18:53.250
Yeah.

18:53.250 --> 18:56.890
I put it in my jacket, but it broke.

18:58.020 --> 19:00.150
I’m sorry!

19:00.150 --> 19:01.910
It doesn’t matter, does it?

19:03.830 --> 19:06.120
It was me.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.530
I’m sorry!

19:10.300 --> 19:12.170
I think it was when...

19:26.480 --> 19:30.000
I destroyed something important to you, didn’t I?

19:30.000 --> 19:33.130
No, it wasn’t deliberate.
Don’t worry about it.

19:33.130 --> 19:35.260
No, it’s my responsibility.

19:35.260 --> 19:38.380
I’ll use my beatrice power to fix it.

19:38.380 --> 19:39.770
Can you do that?

19:39.770 --> 19:40.450
Yes.

19:40.450 --> 19:41.740
Really?!

19:41.740 --> 19:43.160
Thank you!

19:43.160 --> 19:45.120
Great!

19:50.220 --> 19:51.670
A-Are you OK?

19:55.670 --> 19:59.910
<i>I need to apologize to Mamoru...</i>

20:19.100 --> 20:23.160
<i>What? It didn’t break?</i>

20:36.210 --> 20:39.530
Man, that’s cold.

20:39.530 --> 20:41.050
Jeez.

20:45.330 --> 20:47.800
That glass bottle...

20:47.800 --> 20:52.200
It was repaired before I opened the box.

20:52.200 --> 20:55.600
It was a very gentle beatrice power.

20:55.600 --> 21:00.200
The aura was Yoshimura Mamoru’s.

21:03.280 --> 21:04.930
All right!

21:04.930 --> 21:06.730
This one again?

21:04.930 --> 21:09.160
Play-with-Pigs
Petting Zoo

21:17.290 --> 21:20.140
<i>This is the message from my brother...</i>

21:20.140 --> 21:23.720
<i>I am the only man in the world suited for you.</i>

21:25.390 --> 21:30.890
<i>If you’ve grown into an adult woman,
I shall come for you.</i>

21:31.840 --> 21:40.530
<i>Dry your tears and wait with anticipation
and a fluttering heart, my bride.</i>

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.530 --> 23:20.350
There comes a time when a man must stand up.

23:20.350 --> 23:28.110
I won’t turn back, even if I see your hazy image in the steam.

23:28.110 --> 23:34.800
But even so, if you start to panic, I’ll be right there.

23:34.800 --> 23:38.680
I want you, and I love my soul.

23:38.680 --> 23:41.950
Next: Steam Panic!

23:41.950 --> 23:43.940
Check it out!
